{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find yourself on a planet where plants emit and react to sound and light. An alien civilization is harvesting the sounds of these plants. Use your Sphere of Sound and your Sphere of Light to interact with, trigger, and control dozens of plants and more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse in unique sound gameplay mechanics while uncovering the mysteries of the planet in this semi-open world puzzle exploration story-driven game with survival elements.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC MOVEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different types of jumps and switch between your jetpack modes to transpose the planet\u2019s challenging geography, all while you control your Sound and Light Spheres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/cb3e2144c26b808b70613a1add77878a.poster.avif?t=1772663641\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/cb3e2144c26b808b70613a1add77878a.webm?t=1772663641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE MECHANICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your spheres to interact with the plants. Each species of plant or natural resource has its own sound gameplay mechanic to discover, learn, and master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/14c71f3cd41971ce458df421e4167aa9.poster.avif?t=1772663641\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/14c71f3cd41971ce458df421e4167aa9.webm?t=1772663641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/14c71f3cd41971ce458df421e4167aa9.mp4?t=1772663641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INCREASE YOUR CHANCES OF SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your suit has O2 filters for breathing, a battery to power it up, and methane for jetpack fuel. Balance them to avoid the inevitable and find resources on the planet to restore and upgrade your suit. Also, control a set of sound- and music-related functions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/306c8d8378e6d0f4b1fa1ccb69047339.poster.avif?t=1772663641\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/306c8d8378e6d0f4b1fa1ccb69047339.webm?t=1772663641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/306c8d8378e6d0f4b1fa1ccb69047339.mp4?t=1772663641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MYSTERIES AHEAD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in different atmospheric biomes while experiencing a deep and cinematic science fiction story. Interact with your AI, solve puzzles and scan the planet to uncover its lore and sound mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/eed2ffcad75b4ed2381800223585d991.poster.avif?t=1772663641\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/eed2ffcad75b4ed2381800223585d991.webm?t=1772663641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/eed2ffcad75b4ed2381800223585d991.mp4?t=1772663641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEWARE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every plant is harmless. Some plants are attracted to sound in predatory or parasitic ways. Always explore weird caves and alien temples with care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/32521d23af647cfd9b1da4eff30d6a2c.poster.avif?t=1772663641\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/32521d23af647cfd9b1da4eff30d6a2c.webm?t=1772663641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2531570?t=1772663641","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2531570?t=1772663641","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/329e393a0678f2db528391ef9bf312dc50da2cb0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772663641","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/329e393a0678f2db528391ef9bf312dc50da2cb0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772663641","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find yourself on a planet where plants emit and react to sound and light. An alien civilization is harvesting the sounds of these plants. Use your Sphere of Sound and your Sphere of Light to interact with, trigger, and control dozens of plants and more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse in unique sound gameplay mechanics while uncovering the mysteries of the planet in this semi-open world puzzle exploration story-driven game with survival elements.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC MOVEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different types of jumps and switch between your jetpack modes to transpose the planet\u2019s challenging geography, all while you control your Sound and Light Spheres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/cb3e2144c26b808b70613a1add77878a.poster.avif?t=1772663641\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/cb3e2144c26b808b70613a1add77878a.webm?t=1772663641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE MECHANICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your spheres to interact with the plants. Each species of plant or natural resource has its own sound gameplay mechanic to discover, learn, and master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/14c71f3cd41971ce458df421e4167aa9.poster.avif?t=1772663641\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/14c71f3cd41971ce458df421e4167aa9.webm?t=1772663641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/14c71f3cd41971ce458df421e4167aa9.mp4?t=1772663641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INCREASE YOUR CHANCES OF SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your suit has O2 filters for breathing, a battery to power it up, and methane for jetpack fuel. Balance them to avoid the inevitable and find resources on the planet to restore and upgrade your suit. Also, control a set of sound- and music-related functions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/306c8d8378e6d0f4b1fa1ccb69047339.poster.avif?t=1772663641\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/306c8d8378e6d0f4b1fa1ccb69047339.webm?t=1772663641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/306c8d8378e6d0f4b1fa1ccb69047339.mp4?t=1772663641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MYSTERIES AHEAD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in different atmospheric biomes while experiencing a deep and cinematic science fiction story. Interact with your AI, solve puzzles and scan the planet to uncover its lore and sound mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/eed2ffcad75b4ed2381800223585d991.poster.avif?t=1772663641\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/eed2ffcad75b4ed2381800223585d991.webm?t=1772663641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/eed2ffcad75b4ed2381800223585d991.mp4?t=1772663641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEWARE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every plant is harmless. Some plants are attracted to sound in predatory or parasitic ways. Always explore weird caves and alien temples with care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/32521d23af647cfd9b1da4eff30d6a2c.poster.avif?t=1772663641\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/extras/32521d23af647cfd9b1da4eff30d6a2c.webm?t=1772663641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Soundgrass Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531570/b391bb2265fc63bfdcd074bb6f6caad9057e7774/header.jpg?t=1772663641","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2531570/1838059838/7d49fe9d3ca20fbd1b66a68c150ce89a89a9ec6f/1758667773/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758670340","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2531570/1838059838/7d49fe9d3ca20fbd1b66a68c150ce89a89a9ec6f/1758667773/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758670340","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2531570/1838059838/7d49fe9d3ca20fbd1b66a68c150ce89a89a9ec6f/1758667773/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758670340","id":257205072,"name":"Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257205072/85d32988a1c1a9348cb42e63c32b2